">I<pmtudisc_option>] [B<-N\\ >I<nodeinfo_option>] [B<-w\\ >I<deadline>] [B<-"
"W\\ >I<timeout>] [B<-p\\ >I<pattern>] [B<-Q\\ >I<tos>] [B<-s\\ "
">I<packetsize>] [B<-S\\ >I<sndbuf>] [B<-t\\ >I<ttl>] [B<-T\\ >I<timestamp\\ "
